@startuml fs_admin_01_seq_sign_in
skinparam backgroundColor #0F0E17
skinparam defaultFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #A5B4FC
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam sequenceDividerBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam sequenceDividerFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #1A1830
skinparam noteBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam noteFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam titleFontColor #E5E7EB
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #E5E7EB
title FS-ADMIN-01 — Admin sign-in and session checks
autonumber "[00]"

actor "Owner" as O #1E1B4B
participant "Backoffice SPA" as UI #172554
participant "Login endpoint" as L #172554
participant "admin-guard\nmiddleware" as G #172554
database "D1 rate_limits" as RL #052E16

O -> UI : opens /admin (no session)
UI -> UI : route middleware sees no session
UI --> O : redirected to /admin/login with a safe next path

== Sign in ==
O -> UI : email and password
UI -> L : POST /api/admin/auth/login
G -> G : same-origin check on state-changing requests
L -> L : secrets configured
group Secrets missing [503]
  L --> UI : Admin not configured
end
L -> RL : upsert counter for client address (5 per 15 minutes)
group Over the limit [429]
  L --> UI : Too many attempts, Retry-After
end
L -> L : compare email in constant time
L -> L : always verify the scrypt hash
group Either is wrong [401]
  L --> UI : Email or password is incorrect (never says which)
end
L -> L : seal session (email, role admin) into a cookie
L --> UI : 200 + Set-Cookie HttpOnly Secure SameSite Lax, 12 hours
UI --> O : redirected to the requested admin page

== Every admin API call ==
UI -> G : request with the cookie
G -> G : unseal cookie, role is admin
group No valid session [401]
  G --> UI : Unauthorized
end
G --> UI : handler runs
@enduml
